\caption(Two explicit whole-model192-update Adam fits. UNet++ CE averages all four learned heads; attention U-Net CE uses its final head. Validation chooses separate checkpoints before test evaluation.)
\alttext(Two explicit whole-model192-update Adam fits. UNet++ CE averages all four learned heads; attention U-Net CE uses its final head. Validation chooses separate checkpoints before test evaluation.)

Compact UNet++ has573,240 learned scalars and selects epoch24 with
validation mean IoU.598489; test accuracy/mIoU are.858588/.526918.
Compact attention U-Net has491,468 scalars and selects epoch24 with
validation mean IoU.468296; test accuracy/mIoU are.856228/.469080.
Both select their final epoch, so192 updates(kept short so the report
builds quickly) leave the fits unconverged. Background is segmented well
(.980017/.989603) and rectangles partly(.440412/.492096), while circle
(.253090/.143314) and triangle(.434153/.251307) IoU remain weak.
These are separately initialized bounded procedural fits,not evidence of a
general architecture ranking.

