> Conclusion

Analytic gate derivatives and complete graph checks precede compact training. Every nested head contributes explicitly to the objective. Fit-only class weights,validation-selected restoration,actual predictions and fixed-range gate maps expose the results without a biomedical benchmark claim.

> References

- [Zhou et al.(2018), UNet++: A Nested U-Net Architecture for Medical Image Segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.10165).
- [Oktay et al.(2018), Attention U-Net: Learning Where to Look for the Pancreas](https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.03999).
